        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Mud Puddle"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate)\n\nUntil it next acts, the mudwretch appears to be an ordinary puddle of mud.\n\nIt has an automatic result of 20 on Deception checks to pass as a mud puddle and can make a fist Strike against a creature that walks onto the mud puddle as a reaction."
            },
