        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Spew Mud"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(conjuration, primal)\n\nThe mudwretch spews a 20-foot line of pressurized mud that deals 2d10 bludgeoning damage (18 basic Reflex save). On a critical failure, a creature also takes a \u201310-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. The mudwretch can't Spew Mud again for 1d4 rounds."
            },
